{"id":67349,"date":"2025-09-17T07:37:27","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T06:37:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67349"},"modified":"2026-09-10T19:15:12","modified_gmt":"2026-09-10T18:15:12","slug":"lousa-mountain-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lousa-mountain-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Lousa Mountain Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lousa Mountain Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Lousa Mountain Trail 2027<\/strong> atinge a sua emblem\u00e1tica 5.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o no domingo, <strong>17 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, afirmando-se como uma das provas de abertura de temporada mais aguardadas do trail running na regi\u00e3o de Lisboa. Organizado pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Lousa<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trail4U<\/strong>, o evento est\u00e1 formalmente integrado no prestigiado circuito <strong>Merrell Trail Running Series 2026\/2027<\/strong>, combinando desafio atl\u00e9tico de montanha com a valoriza\u00e7\u00e3o paisag\u00edstica e ambiental do concelho de Loures.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partida e meta instalados na sede do <strong>Grupo Desportivo de Lousa<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza tr\u00eas formatos distintos: o desafiante <strong>Trail Longo (K23)<\/strong> com 23 km e 1.200 m D+, o din\u00e2mico <strong>Trail Curto (K13)<\/strong> com 13 km e 600 m D+, e uma magn\u00edfica <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> para os entusiastas da natureza. Os percursos serpentear\u00e3o por trilhos t\u00e9cnicos, linhas de cumeada e estrad\u00f5es florestais da freguesia, assegurando postos de abastecimento l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip integrado no dorsal, gola t\u00e9cnica oficial de oferta e uma calorosa rece\u00e7\u00e3o com abastecimento final e trof\u00e9us para os melhores de cada escal\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-trans